    {
      "name": "Строка кандидата",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "Имя, метаданные, этап и переход в открытой записи.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-demo\"><div class=\"ds-row\"><div><button class=\"ds-name\">Алексей Морозов</button><p class=\"ds-skills\">React, TypeScript</p></div><span>4 года</span><span>180 000 ₽</span><span class=\"ds-stage\">Оффер</span><button class=\"ds-next\">Дальше <svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></button></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-demo{--c-bg:#f3f1ed;--c-surface:#ffffff;--c-surface-sunken:#edeae5;--c-surface-hover:#f8f5f1;--c-ink:#25272b;--c-ink-soft:#55534f;--c-ink-muted:#65615c;--c-line:#dcd8d1;--c-line-strong:#bdb7ae;--c-line-control:#8c857b;--c-brand:#9d493b;--c-brand-hover:#803a2e;--c-brand-soft:#f4e7e2;--c-brand-ink:#813d31;--c-side:var(--c-ink);--c-side-ink-strong:#ffffff;--c-side-active:#ffffff1a;--c-warn-soft:#f2ebd9;--c-warn-ink:#705923;--c-danger:#9b3029;--c-danger-soft:#fbefec;--c-danger-line:#c7857b;--c-focus:var(--c-brand);--c-selection:#eed1c6;--c-backdrop:#25272b66;--c-shadow:#25272b26;--c-skeleton:#e4e0da;--c-skeleton-light:#f5f2ed;--space-1:4px;--space-2:8px;--space-3:12px;--space-4:16px;--space-5:24px;--space-6:32px;--space-7:48px;--gutter:var(--space-4);--text-sm:13px;--text-md:14px;--text-lg:16px;--text-xl:22px;--text-2xl:30px;--leading:1.5;--leading-tight:1.25;--tracking-tight:-0.03em;--weight-regular:400;--weight-medium:500;--weight-strong:600;--radius-sm:3px;--radius:4px;--radius-lg:8px;--focus-ring:2px;--disabled-opacity:0.5;--control:44px;--icon-hit:44px;--sheet:480px;--sheet-wide:640px;--field-max:360px;--content-max:1440px;--label-col:80px;--avatar:48px;--toast-max:420px;--index-width:248px;--role-select:132px;--min-viewport:320px;--header-height:72px;--ease:cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);--fast:160ms;--shimmer:1.4s;--reduced:0.01ms;--underline-offset:3px;font-family:'Manrope', system-ui, sans-serif;font-size:var(--text-md);line-height:var(--leading);color:var(--c-ink);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;} .ds-demo :focus-visible{outline:var(--focus-ring) solid var(--c-focus);outline-offset:var(--focus-ring);} .ds-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) auto;align-items:center;gap:var(--space-2);padding:var(--space-2) 0;border-block:1px solid var(--c-line);font-size:var(--text-sm)}.ds-row>div{grid-column:1/-1}.ds-row:hover{background:var(--c-surface-hover)}.ds-name,.ds-next{font:inherit;border:0;background:transparent;padding:0;cursor:po